ce, one happy moment at a time.</p></section><section class="wrap section split"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1606313564200-e75d5e30476c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85" loading="lazy" alt="Chocolate brownies"><div><span class="eyebrow">Our little philosophy</span><h2>Real ingredients. Unforgettable little moments.</h2><p class="muted">We believe baking should feel like coming home. From nostalgic family favourites to new weekend obsessions, every recipe here is made for real kitchens and real people.</p><a class="btn dark" href="about.html">Read our story →</a></div></section><section class="newsletter"><div class="wrap newsletter-inner"><div><span class="eyebrow">A little extra sweetness</span><h2>Fresh from the oven.</h2><p>Get a new baking idea whenever you visit. Save your favourite recipes to revisit later.</p></div><a href="recipes.html" class="btn dark">Find your next bake →</a></div></section></main><footer><div class="wrap"><div class="footer-row"><div><a href="index.html" class="brand">the velvet oven<small>Bakery & recipe journal</small></a><p>Good things take butter, love, and a little patience.</p></div><div class="footlinks"><a href="recipes.html">Recipes</a><a href="favorites.html">Favourites</a><a href="about.html">About us</a></div></div><div class="copyright">© 2026 The Velvet Oven Bakery · Made for the love of baking.</div></div></footer><script src="data.js"></script><script src="app.js"></script></body></html>
